{"uuid": "e375e9b1-23e1-44fb-a7a1-4858ddfeb2d0", "message": "0011010010001001111001100100010101000110000100110011000110101110", "container": "Freedom of speech is a fundamental right that extends to the online world. The internet has become a crucial platform for people to express their opinions and thoughts freely. However, with this freedom comes responsibility. Online platforms should ensure that hate speech, cyberbullying, and misinformation are curtailed to maintain a safe and inclusive environment. Governments must strike a balance between protecting citizens from harm and preserving their right to freedom of speech. Education on digital literacy and critical thinking is essential to empower individuals to navigate the online world responsibly. Upholding freedom of speech in the online world encourages open dialogue, fosters diverse perspectives, and promotes democratic values.", "encoded_message": "Autonomy of expression is a basic liberty that stretches to the digital realm. The web has emerged as a critical medium for citizens to convey their beliefs and ideas openly. However, with this independence entails accountability. Digital channels should guarantee that abusive communication, online harassment, and disinformation are limited to preserve a secure and comprehensive setting. Authorities must find a balance between protecting citizens from harm and preserving their right to freedom of speech. Education on digital literacy and critical thinking is essential to empower individuals to navigate the online world responsibly. Upholding freedom of speech in the online world encourages open dialogue, fosters diverse perspectives, and promotes democratic values.", "secret_key": [{"Freedom": {"0": "Autonomy", "1": "Liberty"}}, {"of": {"0": "of", "1": "of"}}, {"speech": {"00": "voicing", "01": "expression", "10": "articulation", "11": "utterance"}}, {"is": {"0": "is", "1": "is"}}, {"a": {"0": "a", "1": "a"}}, {"fundamental": {"00": "essential", "01": "elementary",